config BR2_PACKAGE_TOON_BOILER
	bool "toon-boiler"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_CJSON
	select BR2_PACKAGE_TOON_BUS
	select BR2_PACKAGE_OPENSSL
	help
	  toon-boilerd: talks to the Quby boiler module on UART1
	  (4800 8E1). Switches the module between OpenTherm and the
	  on/off contact and publishes what the module collects of the
	  OpenTherm values as retoon/boiler (and retoon/opentherm) on
	  the Toon's own MQTT broker. Also the thermostat: presets,
	  week program, pre-heating and frost protection. Or, instead
	  of the module, an ESP with an OpenTherm adapter running
	  ESPHome, over its encrypted native API.
